000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9,1.9,2,180,180,27,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,36,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,2.95,0,8,23,23,146,1Style: Karaoke-furigana,Duality,36,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,2.95,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Lyrics-furigana,Duality,36,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,2.95,0,2,23,23,34,1Style: Lyrics,Duality,72,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,5.9,0,2,23,23,34,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,72,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,5.9,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Kanji,Duality,72,&H00DC8F37,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,3,0,1,5.9,0,8,23,23,146,1Style: Roger-Monologue,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Romaji ED,Josefin Sans,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H003592BE,&H00000000,&H64000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,4,8,10,10,20,1Style: Translation ED,Josefin Sans,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H64000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,4,2,10,10,20,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:02:00.00,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:57.26,0:01:58.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.35,0:01:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu nasıl yaptı?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.64,0:02:02.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolu uzamış görünüyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.73,0:02:02.10,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçekçi ol!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro'yu kıç üstü yere serdi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerisi sende.Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben hazinelerimi alacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.71,0:02:34.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Usopp Korsanları vardı! – Usopp Korsanları vardı!Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.59,0:02:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uzak durun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hazır ol, aptal uşak!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.52,0:02:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu hak ettin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.18,0:02:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir aptal korsan, huzuru bozuyor...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.06,0:02:50.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O veletler ne yapıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu çocuklar ne yapmaya çalışıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.11,0:02:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kesin şunu, çocuklar... Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Dersini almış olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.96,0:03:10.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kaptan Kuro öfkeden kudurmuş olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan, düşündüğümüz gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onlarla savaşıyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye bize gerçeği söylemedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biz yerli miyiz?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, "yabancı mıyız"?Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimin umurunda?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemen buradan gitmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçın!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.98,0:03:28.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seninle birlikte savaşacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.98,0:03:34.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçarsak, Usopp Korsanları olarak–Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.66,0:03:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sizi aptallar, hemen kaçın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Kaptan! – Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fena değil...Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne tuhaf bir dövüş tekniği...Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.86,0:04:16.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi yediğini varsayabilir miyim?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, lastik meyvesi yedim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.57,0:04:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik adamım!Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Şeytan meyvesi mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.58,0:04:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu çok kötü!Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O şeyler var mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tuhaf olmasına şaşmamalı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek lastik adam.Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.13,0:04:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yani kolunun uzaması halüsinasyon değildi.Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.80,0:04:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango!Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.59,0:04:37.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,E-Evet?Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O çocukla ben ilgileneceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen Kaya hanımefendinin icabına bak.Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Planlandığı gibi vasiyetini yazacak,Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sonra da öldür onu!Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve oradaki üç karınca,Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.61,0:04:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,gözüme batıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.49,0:05:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur.Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.33,0:05:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni geçmene izin vermeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buchi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.46,0:05:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kedi Ezişi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.34,0:05:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gücü öncekine göre çok farklı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.46,0:05:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hay aksi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.71,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.38,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiç gücüm kalmadı...Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin... Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet...Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp Korsanları!Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.39,0:06:14.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– E-Evet, efendim?! – E-Evet, efendim?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptanınızı dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçmayacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana yaptıklarından dolayı...Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,intikamını alacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya'yı koruyun!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.45,0:06:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,size en önemli görevinizi veriyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.08,0:06:40.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya'yı buradan uzaklaştırın!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sakın yapamayız demeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.01,0:06:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan tayfamızı kurma sebebimizi hatırlayın:Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.09,0:06:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzerine en çok titrediğimiz değerleri koruyabilen adamlar olmak!Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san...Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu... kaptanınızın kesin emridir.Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.32,0:07:05.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Başüstüne, Kaptan! – Başüstüne, Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya-san, acele edin!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.61,0:07:07.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu taraftan! Bu taraftan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.07,0:07:07.74,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu taraftan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.37,0:07:10.70,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne zarif bir konuşma...Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Onlara kaçmalarını söylemekle aynı...Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.75,0:07:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu orman, bizim arka bahçemiz gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.34,0:07:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, dalmışım!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal mısınız? Benden asla kaçamayacaksınız!Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.14,0:07:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıldı?Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemen onları yakala, seni aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam be!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.78,0:07:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramaz...Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bildiğim bir şey varsa, o da Kaya'nın ne kadar güçsüz olduğudur.Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango'dan kaçamayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onların arkasından gitmek isteyebilirsin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.71,0:08:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabii bu yokuşu canlı çıkabilirsen...Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.30,0:08:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buchi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana karşı zaten bir kez kaybettin.Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.14,0:08:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vaktimi boşa harcama!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaybol!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.69,0:09:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O hipnozcu hâlâ arkamızda mı?Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, onu göremiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu tamamen kaybedelim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.94,0:09:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizi bu ormanda yakalaması mümkün değil.Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin, Kaya-san.Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sizi koruyacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle! Usopp Korsanları olarak söz veriyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.00,0:09:23.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Teşekkür ederim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.57,0:09:48.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada yoklar.Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.28,0:09:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredesiniz, bücürler?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonsuza dek kaçamazsınız!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.04,0:10:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerekirse tüm ormanı dümdüz ederim!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay...Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok kızmış gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O sadece bir hipnozcu değil, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nereye kaçtılar?Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.51,0:10:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu taraftan!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.23,0:10:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-O da neydi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kim bilir?Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.86,0:10:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango muhtemelen ortalığı dağıtıyordur.Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden gidip kendin öğrenmiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.95,0:10:39.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancak çok geç kalmış olabilirsin.Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Canın cehenneme...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.33,0:10:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üç yıl boyunca onunla yaşadın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiç mi merhametin yok?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.59,0:10:49.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yok!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.75,0:10:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dediğim gibi, Kaya sadece planımın bir parçası.Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.97,0:10:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öldüğünde ona teşekkür ederim.Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.05,0:11:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni...!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.35,0:11:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kötü ruhun kurtuluşu yok...Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten onu kurtarmayı planlamıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidip onlara yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burayı biz devralacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bize bırak!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hâlâ hareket edebiliyor musun? Ne kadar etkileyici.Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni...!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu...Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,yanına bırakmayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.85,0:11:44.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Köylülere ve Kaya'nın hislerine ihanet ettin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.10,0:11:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla plan yapmana izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.03,0:12:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hareket... edemiyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.00,0:12:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni gerçekten eğlendiriyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olduğun yerde kal.Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.59,0:12:19.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten Jango'yu yakalasan bile,Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ona denk biri değilsin.Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada daha güvende olursun.Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denk olmasam bile...Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.44,0:12:32.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ona denk değilsem bile,Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,onları korumak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.03,0:12:39.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben, Usopp Korsanları'nın kaptanıyım,Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.32,0:12:42.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ve denizin cesur savaşçısı olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.03,0:12:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu köye el süremeyeceksin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neyin peşinde?Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.71,0:12:56.17,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şeyler bağırıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baksana, ağlıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Komik olan ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.03,0:13:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.57,0:13:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp'la o hipnozcu ucubeyi yakalayacağız! Sorun olur mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olmaz! Acele edin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.91,0:13:25.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bunun için üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.16,0:13:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aslında tek başıma çok daha hızlı olurum ama ormanın içindeler.Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onlara ulaşmak için bana yol tarifi lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz ikiniz, durun.Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.63,0:13:37.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yokuşu geçme iznini size kim verdi?Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben verdim!Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidin! Zoro! Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir yumruk daha!Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.94,0:13:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik Mızrak!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.52,0:13:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Yine kayboldu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, neyse! Sonuçta geçtiler!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dövüşmeden önce bir şey sormak istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.49,0:14:11.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir yabancı köyün işine ne karışıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.17,0:14:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çünkü bu köyde ölmesini istemediğim biri var.Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.25,0:14:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok basit.Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.88,0:14:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölümünün bu yüzden olmasını istediğinden emin misin?Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eminim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.97,0:14:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama ölmeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana ölümü tattıracağım!Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.77,0:14:37.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik Kırbaç!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve Tabanca!Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.24,0:14:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar sıkıcı!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik...!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Doğuya! Doğuya! Doğu dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.67,0:15:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bilebilirim?! Sağa veya sola söylesene!Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman geriye dön!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu tam tersi!Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.97,0:15:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya-san!Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm...Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz devam edin...Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.27,0:15:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görevimiz sizi korumak!Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.73,0:15:22.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, hayır! Çok ateşi var!Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.57,0:15:24.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Dayanın, Kaya-san!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.65,0:15:25.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doktor...! Doktor çağırın!Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.78,0:15:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni aptal! Bunun için zamanımız yok!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öldürülmek üzereyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama daha fazla kaçamayız.Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine de...Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredesiniz, bücürler?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Teşekkür ederim...Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yardımınıza çok sevindim...Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düşünmeniz bile bana yeter...Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üçünüz de kaçın.Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nereye kaçtınız?Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.19,0:16:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya-san'ı geride bırakıp kaçarsak muhtemelen sağ kalırız, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, muhtemelen.Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.19,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptanımız, kaybedeceksen kaçmamız gerektiğini hep der.Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne de olsa o bir yalancı!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.37,0:16:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O bile mücadele ediyor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.96,0:16:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizi korumak için çok çabaladı!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya-san'ın ölmesine izin veremeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.22,0:16:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam o zaman! Kendinizi hazırlayın, Usopp Korsanları!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.26,0:16:30.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.09,0:16:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi savaşalım!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.55,0:16:32.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz daha çocuksunuz.Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim yüzümden ölemezsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölmek için değil.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.14,0:16:40.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşamak için!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.73,0:16:43.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ağzımı kesti.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.61,0:16:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır şapkalı adam kesinlikle güçlü, ama...Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.49,0:16:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İ-İşte bizim Kaptan Kuro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haklayın onu!Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın Kaptan Kuro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.66,0:16:56.58,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harikasınız, Kaptan Kuro!Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni o isimle çağırmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.04,0:17:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ anlamıyorsunuz, değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.05,0:17:13.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu planın sonucu, "Kaptan Kuro" ismini tamamen ortadan kaldıracak!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Katlanamıyordum artık...Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.43,0:17:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her günüm, sadece kaos isteyen adamlara planlar yaparak ve...Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.44,0:17:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hükûmet köpekleriyle ödül avcılarının peşimden koşmasıyla geçiyordu...Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.94,0:17:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her şeyden bıkmıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Donanma, ha...?Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.04,0:17:42.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,7,,Bu hafta üçüncü oluyor.Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Elden bir şey gelmez.Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.42,0:17:49.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizi kovalamalarına neden olan işler yapıyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca, epey ün kazandın...Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.68,0:17:53.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğru...Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.09,0:17:56.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları bize çeken benim adım.Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.60,0:18:01.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden, Kaptan Kuro olmayı bırakıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.85,0:18:05.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tuhaf bir şey söylediniz.Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.61,0:18:06.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama işe yaramaz.Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.98,0:18:10.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Donanma sizi ölene dek kovalayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.57,0:18:17.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse öleceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.41,0:18:22.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre ben, korsan olmaya uygun değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.71,0:18:25.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama... sen kaptansın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Al senin olsun!Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.59,0:18:32.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu gürültülü yaşam tarzına yeterince katlandım.Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.30,0:18:39.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben... bu dünyadaki beni öldüreceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kuro!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan...Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaç gemileri var?Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,S-Sadece bir!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapalım, Kaptan?Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Karşılık verelim mi?Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Küçük bir sandal indirin.Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.61,0:18:54.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,İndirin dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.41,0:19:00.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,İkinci Kaptan Jango! Kaptan Kuro...!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.33,0:19:01.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, biliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.66,0:19:02.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Biliyor musun?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.58,0:19:05.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Oraya yalnız gitmek çok riskli!Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sakın bana teslim olacağını söylemeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?! Top ateşi kesildi...Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemilerine yanaşın.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Söylediğimi yapın, lanet olasıcalar!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.98,0:19:32.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.24,FlashbacksSecondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, savaşa hazırlanın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.24,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.24,0:19:36.41,FlashbacksSecondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemiye yaklaşın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.24,0:19:36.41,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek böyle olacak...Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.08,0:19:50.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Denizcilerin...Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,hepsini yok etmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi...Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Planımıza başlayalım...Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Kendini topla.Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin hayatını özellikle bağışladım.Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kapa' çeneni...Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Asla yalvarmayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.99,0:20:22.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bitir işimi, lanet olası.Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Cesaretin var.Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.75,0:20:30.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kırık bir çeneyle bu kadarını söyleyebilmen hiç de fena değil.Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.34,0:20:39.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Adı bile olmayan, sıradan bir askere bir ikramda bulunuyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.43,0:20:42.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Minnettar olup kabul et...Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.85,0:20:46.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kuro'nun kellesini!Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.27,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin adın Kaptan Kuro.Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.27,0:20:52.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin adın Kaptan Kuro.Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu vahşet senin eserindi.Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir,Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,iki,Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.44,0:20:58.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.95,0:21:01.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim adım Kaptan Kuro.Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.53,0:21:04.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu vahşet benim eserimdi.Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.37,0:21:08.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve sen de Kaptan Kuro'yu yakalayan adamsın.Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.79,0:21:11.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Üsse dönün ve bu adamı infaz edin.Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.83,0:21:12.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir,Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.75,0:21:13.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,iki,Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.84,0:21:14.80,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.88,0:21:19.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben Kaptan Kuro'yu yakalayan adamım!Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.63,0:21:21.76,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine aynı şey, İkinci Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.22,0:21:23.89,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kusursuz...Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.89,0:21:32.69,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Yerime geçen kişi de ölünce, Kaptan Kuro dünyadan silinecek.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.94,0:21:40.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bugün planım başarılı olursa, hedefim tamamen gerçekleşecek...!Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.99,0:21:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hem para hem de huzur içinde olacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi anlıyor musun, çocuk?Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.20,0:21:51.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üç yıldır süren bu plan, başarısız olmayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.46,0:21:55.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim planım asla başarısız olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.55,0:22:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre esnemekten fazlasını yapabiliyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.51,0:22:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.60,0:22:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan olmak için çok çalıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.81,0:22:13.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek bıktın, ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.56,0:22:18.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denizlerdeki şöhreti kaldıramıyorsan, korsan olmamalısın!Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.78,0:22:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hedefin,Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.03,0:22:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,benimkinin yanına bile yaklaşamaz!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:02:02.10,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kaptan KuroDialogue: 1,0:01:56.68,0:02:02.10,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kaptan KuroDialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:43.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kuro (3 Yıl Önce)Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.50,0:17:43.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kuro (3 Yıl Önce)Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.50,0:17:43.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bin Planlı Kuro (3 Yıl Önce)Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 1,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Feeso Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Feeso Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.78,Credits-2